      "text": [
        "Greetings readers,\nThis relaunch edition takes you through ",
        {
          "bold": "Turing Hut's journey in 2025"
        },
        ", a year filled with innovation, learning, and collaboration. From thrilling coding contests and insightful workshops to community milestones and impactful initiatives, this newsletter captures the essence of what made 2025 an exciting chapter in our story. Dive in as we revisit the moments that defined our year at Turing Hut!"
      ]
    },
