      "alt": "CodeRush Event"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": [
        "Exclusively for ",
        {
          "bold": "1st and 2nd-year students"
        },
        ", this C programming showdown tested speed and logic, drawing ",
        {
          "bold": "200+ enthusiastic participants"
        },
